AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00000092> "Can be identified in the larva by expression of vasa (Slaidina et al., 2020). Only a small subset of pole cells can become germ cells and this fate might be specified by the time the posterior midgut primordium invaginates (Okada, 1998).")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00000092> "primordial germ cell")
