AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00000110> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/fbbt#EmbDevSlim>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00000110> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/fbbt#FB_gloss>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00000110> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/fbbt#cur>)
