AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0089570") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0155831") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0244630") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00000111> "Outermost germ layer of the embryo (Campos-Ortega and Hartenstein, 1997). It is formed from the ectoderm anlage, which includes the cells of the cellular blastoderm monolayer that do not invaginate during gastrulation (Campos-Ortega and Hartenstein, 1997).")
