AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001297> "Glial cells associated with axonal tracts (such as those associated with nerve roots) are excluded from this class of glial cells (Ito et al., 1995). Modeled as 'part of' their 'cell body rind' regions, though in practice some cell body glia have small projections into the neuropil - https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001297> "cell body glial cell")
