# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001446> (larval neuron)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0090460") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0098344") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0231327") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001446> "Neuron that is part of the larval nervous system. Neurons with functional roles in the larva are born during the embryonic phase of neurogenesis and further neurons, with adult-specific roles, are born during the postembryonic phase, which begins during larval development (Lacin and Truman, 2016).")
