AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001718> "This is the common part of the adult (CA, CC, HG) and larval (CA, CC, PG) ring glands, but terminology seems to be very rarely used for the larva - https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001718> "retrocerebral complex")
