# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00002037> (larval segmental nerve)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0089570") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00002037> "Larval nerve found in segments T1-A7 that has two roots, both carrying fibers from the neuromere of the nerve (Campos-Ortega and Hartenstein, 1997). It exits the lateral ventral nerve cord in line with the anterior commissure and its proximal region shares a glial sheath with the intersegmental nerve (Campos-Ortega and Hartenstein, 1997). It does not extend as far dorsally as the intersegmental nerve, and mainly innervates ventral muscles and sense organs (Campos-Ortega and Hartenstein, 1997).")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00002037> "VFB:FBbt_00002037")
