AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003123> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/fbbt#cur>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003123> "adult digestive system")
EquivalentClasses(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003123> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00005055> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002131> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003004>)))
