AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0049409") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0221742") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003666> "Intrinsic neuron of the adult protocerebral bridge. These neurons have somas located in the posterior cell body rind, medial and ventral to the Kenyon cell soma, and fibers that enter the protocerebral bridge laterally.")
