AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003678> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/fbbt#BrainName>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003678> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/fbbt#cur>)
