AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003746> "Cell connectivity in the lamina was determined by analysis of semi-automated EM reconstruction of 749 serial sections of 21 complete lamina cartridges. The number of synaptic connections for Lai (presynaptic/postsynaptic) in a single lamina cartridge with each cell type was the following: R1 (-/36), R2 (1/39), R3 (-/39), R4 (2/37), R5 (2/35), R6 (-/40), L1 (1/-), L2 (1/-), L3 (10/-), L4 (4/2), L5 (4/-), Lai (1), T1 (54/1), C2 (1/5), C3 (1/9), Lawf (-/24) and epithelial glia (87/-) (Rivera-Alba et al., 2011).")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003746> "lamina intrinsic neuron Lai")
