AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0049410") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003775> "A columnar neuron that is intrinsic to the medulla, connecting distal and proximal layers (Fischbach and Dittrich, 1989; Kind et al., 2021). It has its soma in the cell body rind of the medulla (Fischbach and Dittrich, 1989).")
