# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003925> (antennal lobe glomerulus)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0246456") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0246460") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003925> "Discrete partition of the antennal lobe, defined by a specific set of sensory neurons (Bates et al., 2020). There are 51 olfactory and 7 non-olfactory (VP) glomeruli (Bates et al., 2020; Marin et al., 2020).")
