AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00004907> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/fbbt#cur>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00004907> "Can be identified by expression of upd1 (Rust et al., 2020).")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00004907> "polar follicle cell")
