# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00005129> (adult optic lobe columnar neuron)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0049410") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00005129> "Interneuron of the optic lobe whose primary projection extends along the long axis of a single optic column to which it, but not necessarily its collaterals, is restricted.")
