AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00005129> "This definition follows Fischbach and Dittrich (1989) in classifying based on the primary projection. A neuron with broad and extensive collaterals with terminals in adjacent columns is still classified as a columnar neuron under this definition. Other treatments have classified such neurons as tangential.")
