AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FBC:Autogenerated") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00005523> "A(n) primordium that develops into some hindgut proper primordium and some Malpighian tubule primordium. It develops from some hindgut anlage.")
