# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007070> (larval posterior inferior protocerebrum)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0155900") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0211016") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0229672") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007070> "Compartment of the larval inferior protocerebrum found posterior medial to the larval superior clamp (medial inferior protocerebrum) (Hartenstein et al., 2015). The adult central complex arises from secondary axonal tracts of several lineages that invade this region and displace it during pupal development (Pereanu et al., 2010). A small region at its posterior edge remains and gives rise to the adult inferior clamp (posterior inferior protocerebrum) (Pereanu et al., 2010).")
