AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007128> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/fbbt#larval_OF>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007128> "antero-basal tract")
