# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007129> (embryonic/larval periesophageal neuropils)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0155900") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0211016") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0229672") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007129> "Larval counterpart to the adult periesophageal neuropils (Pereanu et al., 2010). It is located adjacent to the esophagus and guides the medial cervical tract (Younossi-Hartenstein et al., 2003; Hartenstein et al., 2015). Its anterior portion corresponds to the tritocerebrum (Hartenstein et al., 2015).")
