AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0208205") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0238440") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007191> "Calyx of the larval mushroom body. It contains dendrites of the larval Kenyon cells (Masuda-Nakagawa et al., 2009; Saumweber et al., 2018). It is organized into around 34 glomeruli, each innervated by a single projection neuron (Masuda-Nakagawa et al., 2009).")
