AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00040050> "The IB corresponds to part of the superior spsl of Otsuna and Ito (2006). The IB also corresponds to the ventral part of the caudalcentral protocerebrum (CCP) of Chiang et al. (2011) and to part of the posterior inferior protocerebrum (Ito et al., 2014).")
