AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00045027> "The anterior wedge corresponds to the inferior part of the vlpr of Otsuna and Ito (2006); the posterior wedge corresponds to part of the plpr (Ito et al., 2014).")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00045027> "wedge")
