AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00047519> "Referred to as 'tectulum' by Namiki et al. (2018), but does not exactly correspond to Power's (1948) tectulum (FBbt:00007727). Originally named 'upper tectulum', as this was the upper of two 'tectulum' layers in Namiki et al. (2018), but this region is the intermediate layer of Court et al. (2020).")
