# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00048266> (adult dopaminergic neuron of gnathal ganglion)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0217751") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0238545") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00048266> "Adult dopaminergic neuron with its cell body in the gnathal ganglion (Marella et al., 2012). The ventral gnathal ganglion has four dopaminergic neurons; a bilateral pair with each neuron arborizing in one half of the subesophageal zone, a relatively anterior unpaired neuron and a relatively posterior unpaired neuron (Marella et al., 2012).")
