# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00048274> (mechanosensory neuron of leg chordotonal organ)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0237124") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00048274> "Mechanosensory neuron that innervates a scolopidium of a chordotonal organ in the leg. These neurons have axon terminals in a stratum of the leg neuropil that partially overlaps the terminals of campaniform sensillum neurons and is relatively dorsal compared to the terminals of other somatosensory neurons (Tsubouchi et al., 2017).")
