# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00049279> (adult midgut region R3ab)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0216495") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0221749") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0222542") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00049279> "Subregion at the anterior end of the adult midgut region R3 encompassing R3a and R3b. It is composed of copper cells (cuprophilic cells) interspersed with interstitial cells. The posterior region R3b is distinguishable from R3a by gene expression.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00049279> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
