# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00051443> (ellipsoid body primordium)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0236656") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00051443> "Primordium of the ellipsoid body in the larval brain (Lovick et al., 2017). An anterior part contains the filopodia of the developing R-neurons (lineage DALv2) and a posterior part is formed by the developing columnar neurons of the central complex (lineages DM1-4) (Lovick et al., 2017). These two parts merge during metamorphosis (Lovick et al., 2017).")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00051443> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
