# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00052057> (epigynial dorsal lobe)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0253444") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00052057> "Dorsal portion of the epigynium above the epigynial ventral lobe (McQueen et al., 2022). The two dorsal lobes (left and right) are fused dorsally into a single sclerite (McQueen et al., 2022). It does not harbor sensilla (bristles) (McQueen et al., 2022).")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00052057> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
