# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00052156> (larval Keilin organ neuron)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0045359") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0089570") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00052156> "Larval sensory neuron that innervates a Keilin organ. There is one Keilin organ in each larval thoracic hemisegment, in the ventral sensory cluster (Dambly-Chaudiere and Ghysen, 1986; Campos-Ortega and Hartenstein, 1997). These neurons fasciculate with the segmental nerve (Campos-Ortega and Hartenstein, 1997).")
