AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00052359> "Nassel et al. (1990) say two of these on each side, but Cheong et al. (2023) only find one per side (both by IHC).")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00052359> "adult metathoracic histaminergic neuron")
