# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00052370> (larval brain ensheathing glial cell)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0229106") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00052370> "Ensheathing glial cell of the larval brain. There are approximately 12 of these cells in each brain hemisphere throughout larval development (Omoto et al., 2015).")
