# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00052788> (mechanosensory neuron of antennal bristle)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0259346") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000028> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00052788> "BM-Ant")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0259346") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00052788> "Mechanosensory neuron that has its dendrite in an antennal bristle. It follows the antennal nerve and terminates in the subesophageal zone (Eichler et al., 2024). In the brain, it has a contralateral projection (Eichler et al., 2024). There is one of these per antennal bristle (around 20 per side) (Eichler et al., 2024).")
