AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0260535") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0260546") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00052815> "Local neuron of the ocellar ganglia (Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Schlegel et al., 2024). It is a small neuron that connects sparsely with photoreceptors from all ocelli (Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Schlegel et al., 2024). There are approximately 16 of these per organism (Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Schlegel et al., 2024).")
