AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00100015> "Presence of presynaptic sites of Johnston's organ neurons determined by immunoreactivity to syntaxin and synaptobrevin::GFP localization (Kamikouchi et al., 2006).")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00100015> "antennal mechanosensory and motor center zone A")
