# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00100503> (adult brain cell body glial mesh)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0206543") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00100503> "Mesh-like structure composed of glial cells found in the cell body rind (cortex) of the adult brain (Awasaki et al., 2008). It is composed of cell body glial cells that locally elaborate and enwrap neuronal cell bodies (Awasaki et al., 2008).")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00100503> <https://www.researchgate.net/scientific-contributions/Simon-Reeve-2162827703>)
