AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00110205> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/fbbt#cur>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00110205> "These cells can be identified by their expression of a Su(H)GBE reporter, indicating active Notch signaling (He et al., 2018; Reiff et al., 2019). Cells expressing this reporter do not differentiate into enteroendocrine cells under normal conditions (Zeng and Hou, 2015). They also express klumpfuss (Reiff et al., 2019).")
