# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00110635> (bilateral local interneuron of the adult antennal lobe)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0210390") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0219809") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00110635> "Local interneuron of the adult antennal lobe that innervates only the ipsilateral and contralateral antennal lobes.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00110635> <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5948-3092>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/date> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00110635> "2013-09-03T15:18:45Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
