AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_02000004> "Connectivity with TM5c inferred from GRASP experiments (Karuppudurai et al., 2014). Connectivity with R7, Mi1, Mi4, Tm20 and lamina monopolar neurons based on EM data (Takemura et al., 2008; Takemura et al., 2015). Assertion in Gao et al. (2008) - FBrf0206213 that (non-DRA) R8 is synapsed to Tm9 is not supported by EM data in Takemura et al. (2015).")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_02000004> "photoreceptor cell R8 of pale ommatidium")
