AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBdv_00005370> "Temporal ordering number - 785. The time at which eclosed flies settle down for wing expansion can vary greatly. If they fail to find a suitable site then expansion can be delayed by several hours.")
