AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.bioassayontology.org/bao#BAO_0000659> "Metazoa comprises of animals, which are multicellular eukaryotic organisms. This includes those having a vertebral column (e.g. fish, frog, snake, bird, human) and those that do not (e.g. worm, fly, star fish, etc).")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://www.bioassayontology.org/bao#BAO_0000659> "metazoa")
